# NAVA Token

A transparent digital token project designed around trust,
accountability, and responsible allocation.

## Principles
- Transparent token supply and allocation
- Verifiable transaction history
- Clearly documented charitable allocations
- Smart-contract-enforced restrictions where required
- Public testing before any mainnet deployment

## Security
No private keys or secret credentials belong in this repository.
No allocation is considered locked until a deployed and audited
smart contract enforces the applicable rules.

## Status
Documentation prototype.
No live token has been deployed.
